msgid "About PrasiBali.ai"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"PrasiBali.ai brings the results of master's thesis research at Universitas "
"Udayana into a web application for analysing the characters of Balinese "
"satua."
msgstr ""

msgid "Research"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The research built three models for satua texts: character identification "
"with entity labels, alias clustering of the different names of a character, "
"and classification of each character group as protagonist or antagonist. The "
"thesis compared many models and features for each task; the research mode of "
"PrasiBali.ai lets you choose them and shows their reference scores from the "
"thesis."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Components that existed before this competition: the balinese-nlp package "
"(character identification and alias clustering), the BaliStoryAnalyzer "
"research software, and the pretrained role classifiers from the thesis "
"experiments. Built for the AI Web Innovation Challenge, Bali Digital "
"Festival 2026: this web application, including the research mode, analysis "
"history, quota and accounts."
msgstr ""

